OL,3,GNEWSAStates websites offline over
OL,4,Acyber-security threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States of Guernsey has taken some
OL,7,Fwebsites temporarily offline as a
OL,8,Fprecaution after international warnings
OL,9,Fover cyber-security flaws found in web
OL,10,Fsoftware.
OL,12,FAffected pages include the government
OL,13,Fsite, the revenue service portal, the
OL,14,Fpost-16 education site, the Beau Sejour
OL,15,Fleisure centre and booking platform
OL,16,Fscuba.
OL,18,FExperts identified weaknesses in
OL,19,Fprogramming language which powers much
OL,20,Fof the internet and a fix was issued
OL,21,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
