OL,3,GNEWSAStates websites offline over
OL,4,Acyber-security threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States said: "We have no evidence
OL,7,Fthat any of our websites have been
OL,8,Faffected. We are acting early because
OL,9,Fit is the safest way to protect the
OL,10,Fpublic and our systems while the fix is
OL,11,Fapplied and tested."
